rs and schools don't have to worry  about worrying about lesson plans or  what to teach each week we take care of  all that for them  which is which is really really helpful  and then the second piece i would call  out is what you talked about and that is  entrepreneurs  so so each of our schools are owned and  operated by individual franchise owners  in the markets and in where those  schools are and the children and  families that they serve and you're also  helping entrepreneurs you're helping you  know people with business minds who are  maybe taking a new step in their careers  or a new path i should say  that's exactly correct and in fact the  majority of our franchise owners uh had  never been in early childhood education  had never been in franchising before  didn't even know about franchising to  your point and what's exciting about it  is we have a we have a lot of franchise  owners that you know they decided hey i  want to re-career i want to do something  different i want to make a bigger  difference in the community in which i  live and they had this passion  that they were able to harness within  within the primo school system what's  great when you think about the las vegas  and reno markets our teams are already  out there curating additional locations  for schools  and so if it's something that  you're interested in and and you're like  you know how how long is this going to  take um there's a lot of times we can  get franchise owners into schools within  eight to nine months our goal in in this  uh this whole journey is  how do we raise great citizens of the  world and and primrose provides the  tools for franchise owners to be able to  do that  thank you again to primrose schools for  sponsoring this segment for more  information or for franchise  opportunities you can call 800 primrose  or visit franchise.primroseschools.com  las vegas now
 

